{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國總統特朗普周五（23日）在佛羅里達州出席競選活動時表示，可能向伊朗再發動一次「小型的史詩怒火」軍事行動，然後軍隊在回國途中再對付古巴。</p><p>美國在2月底向伊朗發動「史詩怒火」行動，導致伊朗當時的最高領導人哈梅內伊等高層死亡，戰爭持續至今已近8個月。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:44:10.492762+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:16:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:58:08.606210+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:38:04.453036+00:00","content_hash":"3ebab6ace5149c932f94d149abeaedbc7d40987d9e39d5ba5288af3111ada643","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}